            "examples": [
              {
                "t": "<b>ã</b> in <b>irmã</b> — sister",
                "n": "The final <b>ã</b> is nasal, not like Spanish 'a'."
              },
              {
                "t": "Ma<b>çã</b> is apple — <span class='hl'>ç</span> sounds like <i>s</i>",
                "n": "Notice the cedilla under the c."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "pt_a0_g1_L_õ",
