            "emoji": "🔤",
            "phonetic": "/s/",
            "translation": "Cedilla — makes <b>c</b> sound like <b>s</b> before <i>a</i>, <i>o</i>, <i>u</i>. <br>It’s like a little hook that turns the hard <i>“k”</i> into a soft <i>“s”</i>.",
